<p>Cook County Treasurer, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.mariapappas.net" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (mariapappas.net)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Runs on financial transparency and modernization of the treasurer&#39;s office, highlighting her Debt Disclosure Ordinance requiring local governments to report their debt and spending, and on technology that makes property tax information accessible online.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
